{aligned}u & =0.3\\,\\frac{\\text{km}}{\\text{min}} \\\\  & =0.3\\,\\frac{\\text{km}}{\\text{min}}\\cdot \\frac{1\\,000\\,\\text{m}}{\\text{km}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{min}}{60\\,\\text{s}} \\\\  & =0.3\\,\\frac{\\cancel{\\text{km}}}{\\cancel{\\text{min}}}\\cdot \\frac{1\\,000\\,\\text{m}}{\\cancel{\\text{km}}}\\cdot \\frac{\\cancel{\\text{min}}}{60\\,\\text{s}} \\\\  & =0.3\\cdot \\frac{1000\\,\\text{m}}{60\\,\\text{s}} \\\\  & =5\\,\\text{m/s}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- The marble falls for $t=5\\,\\text{s}.$\n\n- The acceleration due to gravity is $g=9.8\\,{\\text{m/s}}^{2}.$\n\nSubstituting these values into the formula, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}s & =ut+\\frac{1}{2}g{t}^{2} \\\\  & =(5)(5)+\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot (9.8)(5)^{2} \\\\  & =25+(4.9)(25) \\\\  & =147.5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the building is $147.5\\,\\text{m}$ high." 13194139534678 true] [17592186302886 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302887 13194139534678 true] [17592186302886 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302888 13194139534678 true] [17592186302886 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302889 13194139534678 true] [17592186302886 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302890 13194139534678 true] [17592186302886 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302891 13194139534678 true] [17592186302886 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534678 true] [17592186302886 1041 "selection" 13194139534678 true] [17592186302886 1104 #edb/ref 17592186302888 13194139534678 true] [17592186302886 1110 #uuid "79c27fe7-19b3-59a9-a5a7-c3f904afa217" 13194139534678 true] [17592186302887 1034 "270.0\\,\\text{m}" 13194139534678 true] [17592186302887 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534678 true] [17592186302887 1111 #uuid "a8225847-f244-5cd7-b62b-841916cfb99c" 13194139534678 true] [17592186302888 1034 "147.5\\,\\text{m}" 13194139534678 true] [17592186302888 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534678 true] [17592186302888 1111 #uuid "9afa2353-734a-5a25-aeae-b86c5e3c0346" 13194139534678 true] [17592186302889 1034 "74.0\\,\\text{m}" 13194139534678 true] [17592186302889 1103 #